From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:28:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 24/52] Add per-model OpenRouter priority tabs to the embedded
 AI settings

A Balanced / Latency / Cost / Throughput segmented control under the fast
and expanded models (host.ai.fast_priority, host.ai.expanded_priority) that
the host sends as OpenRouter's provider.sort. Both default to latency, the
order the host used before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
